{"description":"Appends a timestamped entry to .kiro/logs/recon-audit.log after every agent-driven recon tool call (enumerate_subdomains, check_takeover, resolve_records), as required by the ethics steering: log what was queried so the operator can audit agent-driven recon after the fact. The log directory is git-ignored; findings about third-party domains are never committed.","enabled":true,"name":"Recon audit log","then":{"command":"mkdir -p .kiro/logs && { printf '%s ' \"$(date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ)\"; cat; echo; } >> .kiro/logs/recon-audit.log || true","type":"runCommand"},"version":"1","when":{"matcher":"enumerate_subdomains|check_takeover|resolve_records","type":"postToolUse"}}